<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN RIETUMU INDEX CLIMBS 0.24 PCT TO 151.06.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN RIETUMU INDEX CLIMBS 0.24 PCT TO 151.06.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index climbed 0.24 percent to 151.06 on Thursday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newstoom +371 721 52 40</p>
